# Everything the image build has no use for. Keeping this tight matters twice:
# it is the build context uploaded to the daemon, and it is what invalidates
# the layer cache when it changes.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
cli/target
.git
.github
docker
specs
*.md

# CodeSeal ciphertext. The image is built from the DECRYPTED tree, so the
# blobs are dead weight in the build context — and shipping the ciphertext
# inside an image that already contains the plaintext helps nobody.
.sgit/
